    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Nitroimidazole active against most obligate anaerobes. Its reduced form and free radicals can interact with DNA, inhibiting DNA synthesis; the precise mechanism is unclear."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
